# cream paper, neutral ink, one orange accent (ember), moss green.
# The design has no red, blue, magenta or cyan, so those ANSI slots are muted,
# warm picks that read at 5:1 or better on the paper. The yellow slots carry the
# ember orange, so programs that highlight in yellow show the accent instead.

